<section class="container hero fade-in">
	<span class="hero__eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Live with the Spotify Web API</span>
	<h1 class="hero__title">
		{{#if user}}
			Welcome back, <span class="grad">{{user.username}}</span>
		{{else}}
			Be your friends' <span class="grad">in‑app DJ</span>.
		{{/if}}
	</h1>
	<p class="hero__lead">
		{{#if user}}
			Queue up the next track on a friend's Spotify in one tap. Tap into your circle below.
		{{else}}
			Queued Up connects to Spotify so you can drop songs straight into a friend's playback queue. No file sharing, no playlists — just real‑time taste.
		{{/if}}
	</p>
	<div class="hero__cta">
		{{#if user}}
			<a href="/friends" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">
				<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
				Open friends
			</a>
			<a href="/search" class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg">Discover people</a>
		{{else}}
			<a href="/auth/spotify" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">
				<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 0C5.4 0 0 5.4 0 12s5.4 12 12 12 12-5.4 12-12S18.66 0 12 0zm5.521 17.34c-.24.359-.66.48-1.021.24-2.82-1.74-6.36-2.101-10.561-1.141-.418.122-.779-.179-.899-.539-.12-.421.18-.78.54-.9 4.56-1.021 8.52-.6 11.64 1.32.42.18.479.659.301 1.02zm1.44-3.3c-.301.42-.841.6-1.262.3-3.239-1.98-8.159-2.58-11.939-1.38-.479.12-1.02-.12-1.14-.6-.12-.48.12-1.021.6-1.141C9.6 9.9 15 10.561 18.72 12.84c.361.181.54.78.241 1.2zm.12-3.36C15.24 8.4 8.82 8.16 5.16 9.301c-.6.179-1.2-.181-1.38-.721-.18-.601.18-1.2.72-1.381 4.26-1.26 11.28-1.02 15.721 1.621.539.3.719 1.02.42 1.56-.299.421-1.02.599-1.56.3z"/></svg>
				Continue with Spotify
			</a>
			<a href="#how" class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg">How it works</a>
		{{/if}}
	</div>
</section>

<section id="how" class="container section">
	<div class="section__head">
		<div>
			<h2 class="section__title">How it works</h2>
			<p class="section__lead">Four steps, ninety seconds. Then your friends are at your mercy.</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="features">
		<article class="feature">
			<div class="feature__icon">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
			</div>
			<h3>1 · Sign in with Spotify</h3>
			<p>One‑tap OAuth. We only ask for the scopes we need to read your profile and push to the queue.</p>
		</article>

		<article class="feature">
			<div class="feature__icon">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
			</div>
			<h3>2 · Find your people</h3>
			<p>Search by name, send a request, and they're in your circle as soon as they accept.</p>
		</article>

		<article class="feature">
			<div class="feature__icon">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 18V5l12-2v13"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="16" r="3"/></svg>
			</div>
			<h3>3 · Pick the perfect track</h3>
			<p>Search the entire Spotify catalog from inside Queued Up and preview before you commit.</p>
		</article>

		<article class="feature">
			<div class="feature__icon">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 11 12 14 22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/></svg>
			</div>
			<h3>4 · Drop it in their queue</h3>
			<p>The song lands in their Spotify queue instantly. They keep listening — you control what's next.</p>
		</article>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="container section">
	<div class="section__head">
		<div>
			<h2 class="section__title">Things to know</h2>
			<p class="section__lead">A few caveats so the magic doesn't break.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="features">
		<article class="feature">
			<div class="feature__icon">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
			</div>
			<h3>Spotify Premium required</h3>
			<p>The Spotify Web API only allows queue mutations for Premium accounts. That's a Spotify limit, not ours.</p>
		</article>
		<article class="feature">
			<div class="feature__icon">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5"/><path d="M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 0 1 0 7.07"/></svg>
			</div>
			<h3>They need to be playing</h3>
			<p>Your friend has to be actively listening on a Spotify device for the queue addition to land.</p>
		</article>
		<article class="feature">
			<div class="feature__icon">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
			</div>
			<h3>Tokens refresh daily</h3>
			<p>Spotify access tokens expire after about an hour. If a friend hasn't logged in lately, ask them to pop in.</p>
		</article>
	</div>
</section>
